{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>據《證券時報》報道，中國製造設備供應商快意智能設備在季度業績簡報中，可能提及了 Apple 傳聞中的智能眼鏡及配備相機的 AirPods。該公司聲稱已參與「Apple AI 眼鏡和新款智能耳機項目」，這可能會帶動其機器視覺檢測設備的需求。</p>\n<h2>2027 年推出智能眼鏡計劃</h2>\n<p>據報道，Apple 正瞄準於 2027 年底推出首款智能眼鏡，預計該產品能協助佩戴者解答關於周圍環境的問題並進行語言翻譯。此外，Apple 也在開發配備相機的 AirPods，預計將與 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iphone-20/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone 20</a> 週年紀念版一同面世。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 AirPods 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1072\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/airpodspro2-a.jpg\" width=\"1662\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:19:20.886500+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:10:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:43.060923+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:51.399540+00:00","content_hash":"12d14512df01f146ccaabcaeaf4813538dcdf4448a477f8a179aba83f30d1880","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}